{"3964290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ollie's Castle", "steam_appid": 3964290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ollie's Castle blends idle gameplay with 3D adventure. Gather resources, automate gains and restore the old castle lost to ruin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build, Gather and Automate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees, mine ore, harvest crops, and fight enemies to gather basic resources and rebuild your world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock refineries and workbenches to craft more advanced materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire helpers and creatures to help gather for you while you're exploring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up skills to unlock bonuses and rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore your Kingdom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild 12 total parts of your castle including </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Library</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throne Hall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vault </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trophy Room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unlock brings you one step closer to unlocking permanent bonuses for future playthroughs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rewards</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ pets to earn and unlock. Bond with your new friends to earn extra color variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilding certain structures will allow for random events to spawn that will give temporary boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige to earn points used to unlock new pets and permanent bonuses</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meadow:  </strong><br>This is where you chop trees, and bring them to the lumberyard to turn them into planks.  <br>Hire Tree Hounds to help gather wood, or Mechabots to assist with loading logs onto the sawmill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964290/extras/e3155c84c5043f82cec9c474f655ea9e.poster.avif?t=1780457586\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964290/extras/e3155c84c5043f82cec9c474f655ea9e.webm?t=1780457586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964290/extras/e3155c84c5043f82cec9c474f655ea9e.mp4?t=1780457586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the caves to mine valuable ore. Hire Golems to collect for you while you're away.<br>Repair the forges to be able to smelt down your ore into ingots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964290/extras/665c32e152789912a719f06318bb9d9a.poster.avif?t=1780457586\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964290/extras/665c32e152789912a719f06318bb9d9a.webm?t=1780457586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964290/extras/665c32e152789912a719f06318bb9d9a.mp4?t=1780457586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm, Grow and fertilize crops with the help of Mushroom workers. <br>Unlock animals to feed and care for, and hire an unlikely farmer to lend a hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964290/extras/4ad9b9d756521b4b879a7c1de3c07da5.poster.avif?t=1780457586\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964290/extras/4ad9b9d756521b4b879a7c1de3c07da5.webm?t=1780457586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964290/extras/4ad9b9d756521b4b879a7c1de3c07da5.mp4?t=1780457586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through enemies to collect Corrupt Shards and hire soldiers to fight beside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild ritual sites and cleanse the corruption from the shards to receive crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964290/extras/0699454370e8c43483341cb82be501e7.poster.avif?t=1780457586\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964290/extras/0699454370e8c43483341cb82be501e7.webm?t=1780457586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964290/extras/0699454370e8c43483341cb82be501e7.mp4?t=1780457586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ollie's Castle blends idle gameplay with 3D adventure. Gather resources, automate gains and restore the old castle lost to ruin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build, Gather and Automate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees, mine ore, harvest crops, and fight enemies to gather basic resources and rebuild your world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock refineries and workbenches to craft more advanced materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire helpers and creatures to help gather for you while you're exploring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up skills to unlock bonuses and rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore your Kingdom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild 12 total parts of your castle including </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Library</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throne Hall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vault </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trophy Room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unlock brings you one step closer to unlocking permanent bonuses for future playthroughs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rewards</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ pets to earn and unlock. Bond with your new friends to earn extra color variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilding certain structures will allow for random events to spawn that will give temporary boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige to earn points used to unlock new pets and permanent bonuses</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meadow:  </strong><br>This is where you chop trees, and bring them to the lumberyard to turn them into planks.  <br>Hire Tree Hounds to help gather wood, or Mechabots to assist with loading logs onto the sawmill.